{{fbdoc item="title" value="__FB_M68K__"}}----
Intrinsic define set for Motorola 68000-family targets.

{{fbdoc item="syntax"}}
	""__FB_M68K__""

{{fbdoc item="desc"}}
	Define without a value created at compile time when the target CPU family is m68k.  The current target form is AROS m68k.  It also defines ##[[KeyPgDdFBBigEndian|__FB_BIGENDIAN__]]## because the target stores multi-byte values in big-endian order.

{{fbdoc item="ex"}}
%%(freebasic)
#ifdef __FB_M68K__
	print "m68k target"
#endif
%%

{{fbdoc item="ver"}}
	- Since fbc 1.20.3

{{fbdoc item="see"}}
	- ##[[KeyPgDdfbaros|__FB_AROS__]]##
	- ##[[KeyPgDdFBBigEndian|__FB_BIGENDIAN__]]##
	- ##[[CompilerOpttarget|Compiler Option: -target]]##

